  "description": "The current production run is configured for twelve batches. Two shell resources are defined: the first, identified as **shell1**, is available at http://example.com/shell1 and has a size of\u202f1500 units; the second, **shell2**, resides at http://example.com/shell2, measures\u202f2300 units, and occupies a bounding box from (0,\u202f0) to (10,\u202f10). Tyson integration is not enabled for this configuration.\n\nThe assembly model includes two shapes. **Shape\u202fA** (id\u202f=\u202fshapeA) contains a single child that references **shell1** with a translation transform of\u202ftranslate(0,0,0); it has no direct annotations or additional shells. **Shape\u202fB** (id\u202f=\u202fshapeB) likewise has one child, this time referencing **shell2** with a rotation transform of\u202frotate(90,0,0,1), and also carries no annotations or shells.\n\nThe product catalog lists a single item: the **Widget** (product\u202fid\u202f=\u202fprod001) is slated for the \u201cassembly\u201d step. It presently has no associated shapes or child components. The overall model is rooted at **rootNode**, and a single annotation is attached to the project\u2014annotation **anno1** located at http://example.com/annotation1.",
